=== Okamoto et al.\ 2019 — Synergistic Pressor Effect of Atomoxetine and Pyridostigmine

    *Full Citation:*: Okamoto LE, Shibao CA, Gamboa A, Diedrich A. Synergistic Pressor Effect of Atomoxetine and Pyridostigmine in Patients With Neurogenic Orthostatic Hypotension. _Hypertension_. 2019;73(1):235-241.
