    *Full Citation:*: Shibao CA, Okamoto LE, Gamboa A, Yu C. Comparative efficacy of yohimbine against pyridostigmine for the treatment of orthostatic hypotension in autonomic failure. _Hypertension_. 2010;56(5):847-851.
