    *Key Findings:*:
        - Pyridostigmine has modest, low-certainty evidence in POTS; cholinergic side effects commonly limit dose.
    *Conclusion:*: The pyridostigmine therapeutic window is real but narrow; dose is side-effect-limited.
    *Limitations:*: POTS population; low-certainty primary studies.

