=== Zaitsu et al.\ 2007 — Estradiol Activates Mast Cells via Non-Genomic ERα

    *Full Citation:*: Zaitsu M, Narita S, Lambert KC, Grady JJ. Estradiol activates mast cells via a non-genomic estrogen receptor-alpha and calcium influx. _Molecular Immunology_. 2007;44(8):1977-1985.
