=== Imhann et al.\ 2016 — Proton Pump Inhibitors Affect the Gut Microbiome

    *Full Citation:*: Imhann F, Bonder MJ, Vich Vila A, Fu J. Proton pump inhibitors affect the gut microbiome. _Gut_. 2016;65(5):740-748.
